            "line": 2,
            "severity": "high",
            "rationale": "In an async function, client.post is called without await; for an async HTTP client this returns a coroutine, so response.status_code on line 3 reads an attribute of an un-awaited coroutine rather than the real response."
          },
          {
            "category": "missing_timeout",
            "line": 2,
            "severity": "medium",
            "rationale": "The outbound POST to '/notify' specifies no timeout, so the call can hang indefinitely on a stalled connection."
